            </div>
            <Cursor class="sr-gap__cursor absolute top-[63px] left-[242px]" rotate={-34} />
            <p class="sr-gap__note absolute top-[58px] right-[17px] w-[119px] text-[14px] leading-[1.3] font-medium tracking-[-0.02em] text-muted-2 max-[950px]:static max-[950px]:w-auto max-[950px]:mt-[16px]">Nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip.</p>
