        </p>
      </Inner>
      <div class="sr-steps flex flex-col gap-[200px] mt-[40px] max-[1200px]:gap-[40px]">
        <div class:list={['sr-step', stepBase]} data-reveal="up">
          <h4 class:list={['sr-step__h', stepHeading]}>Step <em class="italic">#1</em></h4>
          <img class:list={['sr-step__img', stepImg]} style="left:259px" src={stepShot} alt={stepAlt} width="1504" height="978" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <Note vertical top={42} left={313} line={30} width={225} lineOffset={40}>
            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipiscing elit sed. Do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua enim ad minim.
